## Intent & Decisions
Fix the inference acceptance failure that blocked release PR #549
(0.29.0, run 42290325887, job 128145081389). The user linked the
failing step; the fix was made without a separate discussion because
the cause was a regression from #535 and the fix is one filter.
Chosen: drop the x.y.z regex for dynamo-vllm and keep only the
LIFECYCLE_STABLE filter. Rejected: a regex allowing +build metadata;
it adds a rule that the data does not need.

