## Findings & Constraints
- QA dynamo-vllm versions at failure time: 0.26.x and 0.27.x
  +crwv.N mostly LIFECYCLE_DEPRECATED, 0.27.0+crwv.13 UNSTABLE,
  0.28.0+crwv.0 and later LIFECYCLE_STABLE.
- Terraform iterates map keys in lexical order, so [0] is the
  lexically smallest stable version.
- The provider semverPattern accepts build metadata (a9d1221, #329).

